设内容及规模:本项目体育场建设用地面积约2152㎡，总建筑面积约8608㎡;包括游泳池、羽毛球场器械区、运动准备室、篮球场等，总投资约5000万元。 \n2.项目业主：宜宾市叙州区第二中学校。;<br/></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 40pt;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: none; width: 178.3pt; height: 22pt;\">\n<p style='margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22pt; font-family: \"Calibri\",sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; -ms-text-justify: none;'>本项目估算金额(万元)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: none; width: 178.3pt; height: 22pt;\">\n<p style='margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: 22pt; font-family: \"Calibri\",sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; -ms-text-justify: none;'>5000.0</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: none; width: 178.3pt; height: 22pt;\">\n<p style='margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22pt; font-family: \"Calibri\",sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; -ms-text-justify: none;'>类似业绩</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: none; width: 178.3pt; height: 22pt;\">\n<p style='margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22pt; font-family: \"Calibri\",sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; -ms-text-justify: none;'>房屋建筑\n</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: none; width: 178.3pt; height: 22pt;\">\n<p style='margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22pt; font-family: \"Calibri\",sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; -ms-text-justify: none;'>是否允许有不良记录</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid windowtext; border-image: none; width: 178.3pt; height: 22pt;\">\n<p style='margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22pt; font-family: \"Calibri\",sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; -ms-text-justify: none;'>否\n</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22pt;\"